# Preserve supplied and generated binary assets byte-for-byte.
# The retained EVA samples are the stated source of the archive's layout, and
# core.autocrlf silently rewrote their line endings on commit -- so a claim
# about their bytes was unfalsifiable and was, in fact, recorded wrong. Pinned
# so the working tree matches the blob on every platform and the claim is
# checkable (ENG-014 review).
reference/eva_information/*.json text eol=lf
reference/**/*.xlsm binary
src/Pegasus.Infrastructure/Persistence/ReferenceData/provider-domains.v1.json binary
reference/workproviders-and-repairers/principal-identification-corpus.v1.json binary
*.doc binary
*.docx binary
*.ico binary
*.jpeg binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.xls binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary
*.onnx binary
src/Pegasus.Infrastructure/Vision/Models/*.yaml binary
